# Sales planning, step 2: clients

A client is a person or company you are selling to. The main contact is a link to a contact, so the same person can be linked from anywhere without typing their details again. When the document is imported in the default mode, a contact that does not exist yet is created.

```bss
t SalesPlan|usl
    A sales plan for a period: what you aim to sell, and who you will sell it to.
    s+                          Name|Plan|e.g. "Sales Q4 2026"
    dd                          StartDate|Starts|The first day of the period
    dd|(EndDate >= StartDate)   EndDate|Ends|The last day of the period
    n+|0..                      Target|Target|How much you aim to sell in the period
    l:ucl                       Clients|Clients|The people and companies you are selling to

t Client|ucl
    A person or company you are selling to.
    s+        Name|Client|The client's name
    r:tc      MainContact|Main Contact|The person you deal with
```
